// mark-below-par and PIK signals reflect credit quality, not capital-structure
// composition.
//
// pct_below_95 / pct_below_90: % of positions with a price mark (fair value ÷
//   par, the same mark as the credit heatmaps) marked below 95c / 90c of par;
//   n_positions_marked is the denominator; null when none has a mark.
//
// pct_non_accrual: denominator counts only positions whose non-accrual status
//   is decoded for that quarter (unknown status is left out, never zero).
// pct_modified: denominator counts only positions with parseable PIK info
//   (so a loan-life cash-to-PIK flip can be detected).
